Choose 20 cards and we send you 32 for $89.90."], [61.56, 63.94, "Over 30,000 homes use capture cards"], [63.94, 65.28, "and we've sold out before."], [65.92, 67.74, "So if you've been thinking about it, don't wait."], [68.24, 71.12, "Every order is covered by our 90-day money-back guarantee."], [71.72, 73.08, "If you're still seeing the link below,"], [73.4, 74.06, "there's still stock."], [74.64, 75.74, "Get yours before it's gone."]]}